Evidence pack treated as given. Byte maps below are from `tre_reader.py`, `tre_decrypt.py`, and `swg_iff/reader.py` / `swg_iff/writer.py` (IFF validator/writer cited where the evidence pack references IFF repair semantics but no repair implementation exists in the TRE modules).

