## 5. Gotchas for a writer

| # | Area | Gotcha | Detail | Source |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | TRE header | All multi-byte integers LE | `"<4s4s7I"`, TOC/name flags as `uint32` | ```29:29``` · ```172:173:swg_pipeline/tre_reader.py``` |
| 2 | TRE version tag | 4-byte Latin-1 ASCII tag, not numeric | e.g. `b"0005"` | ```166:166:swg_pipeline/tre_reader.py``` |
| 3 | TOC stride vs decode | `6000`/`0006`: 32-byte stride, only 24 bytes defined | 8-byte pad per entry unless fmt extended | ```141:142``` · ```31:33:swg_pipeline/tre_reader.py``` |
